{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:40:05+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Minimal", "steam_appid": 448550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple rules. Tricky puzzles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click a tile to change colors around them and match the target pattern above. More colors enter the mix as you progress, making the solution harder to solve. Some levels contain additional mirroring mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/bb826bb73f9abd71508f04ab5241fefc.poster.avif?t=1788985636\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/bb826bb73f9abd71508f04ab5241fefc.webm?t=1788985636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/bb826bb73f9abd71508f04ab5241fefc.mp4?t=1788985636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make every move count.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 250+ handcrafted puzzles and earn stars by finishing on par. Experiment freely with undo/reset, use a hints if you are lost, or try another puzzle and return later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/081dc565b3f30bb4d4ecec0f5548c96a.poster.avif?t=1788985636\" aria-label=\"Video of Hints / Map / Undo\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/081dc565b3f30bb4d4ecec0f5548c96a.webm?t=1788985636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/081dc565b3f30bb4d4ecec0f5548c96a.mp4?t=1788985636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 250 handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Par move count for each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo, restart, and hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple color palettes and color blindness options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse, keyboard, and controller support.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple rules. Tricky puzzles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click a tile to change colors around them and match the target pattern above. More colors enter the mix as you progress, making the solution harder to solve. Some levels contain additional mirroring mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/bb826bb73f9abd71508f04ab5241fefc.poster.avif?t=1788985636\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/bb826bb73f9abd71508f04ab5241fefc.webm?t=1788985636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/bb826bb73f9abd71508f04ab5241fefc.mp4?t=1788985636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make every move count.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 250+ handcrafted puzzles and earn stars by finishing on par. Experiment freely with undo/reset, use a hints if you are lost, or try another puzzle and return later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/081dc565b3f30bb4d4ecec0f5548c96a.poster.avif?t=1788985636\" aria-label=\"Video of Hints / Map / Undo\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/081dc565b3f30bb4d4ecec0f5548c96a.webm?t=1788985636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/extras/081dc565b3f30bb4d4ecec0f5548c96a.mp4?t=1788985636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 250 handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Par move count for each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo, restart, and hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple color palettes and color blindness options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse, keyboard, and controller support.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A minimalist logic puzzle game where every click changes the colors of neighboring tiles. Match the target pattern across 250+ handcrafted levels, then challenge yourself to solve each in as few moves as possible. Simple rules, increasingly tricky puzzles.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Polish, Spanish - Latin America, Italian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Vietnamese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/36f3d458137a0424faf8628cbbf40e1dc918885f/header.jpg?t=1788985636", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/6182f8f5230d515649b7e948964f95a6b08d0dfb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788985636", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/448550/6182f8f5230d515649b7e948964f95a6b08d0dfb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788985636", "website": "http://minimal.gammosaur.com", "pc_requirements": {"mi